# Portrait phone (DPR 3), by touch: a tap on a tile in the ball's row rolls to it (studio-1), a swipe on the board
# and an arrow button (studio-2), then studio-3 with an arrow, Undo, Hint, Restart and the four arrows; the
# finish card's Levels button opens the list with 9 stars.
# viewport 390x844@3
until 300 =Play
frames 150
save phone-title
touch =Play
until 60 =Studio · 1
frames 30
save phone-game
touch 85% 51%
until 120 =Painted!
frames 30
save phone-complete
touch =Next level
until 60 =Studio · 2
frames 30
swipe 30% 45% 70% 45% 6
frames 40
touch =Roll down
until 120 =Painted!
frames 30
touch =Next level
until 60 =Studio · 3
frames 30
touch =Roll down
frames 40
touch =Undo
frames 10
touch =Hint
until 30 Try rolling
frames 10
save phone-hint
touch =Roll down
frames 40
touch =Restart
frames 20
touch =Roll down
frames 40
touch =Roll right
frames 40
touch =Roll up
frames 40
touch =Roll left
until 120 =Painted!
frames 30
touch =Levels #2
until 60 ★ 9 / 180
frames 10
save phone-levels
